        agriculture=['Olive oil (over 10 million olive trees, producing premium extra virgin olive oil: Nabali and Souri varieties)', 'Medjool dates (Jordan Valley / Jericho)', 'Citrus fruits, strawberries, and greenhouse vegetables', 'Grapes and grape molasses (Hebron)', 'Figs and almonds', 'Sheep and goat dairy (Nabulsi cheese)'],
