        energy='Heavily reliant on imported electricity from the Israel Electric Corporation; expanding distributed rooftop solar PV systems across West Bank universities and public schools; independent Gaza power plant historically fueled by diesel',
        exports=['Building stone and polished marble slabs', 'Extra virgin olive oil and table olives', 'Medjool dates (Jericho)', 'Packaged pharmaceuticals', 'Nabulsi olive oil soap', 'Textiles, footwear, and embroidered goods'],
