        tourism='Deep religious and cultural pilgrimage tourism centered on the Church of the Nativity in Bethlehem (birthplace of Jesus Christ), Al-Aqsa Mosque and Church of the Holy Sepulchre in East Jerusalem, ancient Jericho (oldest city on Earth), and the Ibrahimi Mosque / Cave of the Patriarchs in Hebron.',
