        clothing='The Palestinian Keffiyeh (black-and-white checkered scarf, global symbol of solidarity); Thobe (traditional linen or velvet dress adorned with rich hand-stitched Tatreez embroidery specific to each village and town); modern casual fashion in urban centers.',
        holidays=['Independence Day (November 15)', 'Nakba Day (May 15)', 'Land Day (March 30)', 'Christmas Day (December 25 and January 7)', 'Eid al-Fitr', 'Eid al-Adha', 'New Year\'s Day'],
