        flagDescription='Three equal horizontal bands of black (representing the Abbasid Caliphate), white (Umayyad Caliphate), and green (Fatimid Caliphate), with a red chevron/triangle based on the hoist side (representing the Khawarij and the Great Arab Revolt).',
        coatOfArmsDescription='The golden Eagle of Saladin facing dexter, bearing on its breast a shield in the national flag colors (black, white, green, with a red chevron), clutching a scroll in its talons inscribed "Palestine" in Arabic calligraphy.',
        symbols={'animal': 'Mountain gazelle (Gazella gazella)', 'bird': 'Palestine sunbird (Cinnyris osea)', 'tree': 'Olive tree (Zaytun - symbol of peace and steadfastness)', 'flower': 'Faqua iris (Iris haynei) / Red poppy'},
        landmarks=['Church of the Nativity and Manger Square (Bethlehem)', 'Al-Aqsa Mosque and Dome of the Rock (East Jerusalem)', 'Tell es-Sultan (Ancient Jericho - world\'s oldest walled city)', 'Hisham\'s Palace and the Tree of Life Mosaic (Jericho)', 'Ibrahimi Mosque / Cave of the Patriarchs (Hebron)', 'Battir ancient stone terraces and Roman irrigation pools', 'Old City of Nablus (soap factories and spice markets)', 'Mar Saba Greek Orthodox Monastery'],
