        worldHeritageSites=['Baroque Churches of the Philippines (San Agustin Manila, Paoay, Santa Maria, Miagao)', 'Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park (pristine marine sanctuary in the Sulu Sea)', 'Rice Terraces of the Philippine Cordilleras (Banaue, Batad, Mayoyao, Hungduan - hand-carved 2,000-year-old mountain terraces)', 'Historic City of Vigan', 'Puerto-Princesa Subterranean River National Park (spectacular navigable underground river cavern)', 'Mount Hamiguitan Range Wildlife Sanctuary'],
