        energy='Historically powered by natural gas and crude; executing the National Renewable Energy Program (NREP) targeting 50% renewable power by 2030 (Sudair 1,500 MW solar plant, Dumat Al Jandal wind farm); constructing the world\'s largest commercial green hydrogen plant in NEOM (NEOM Green Hydrogen Company)',
