        dance='Saudi Ardah (UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage: monumental national sword dance performed by men in lines wearing traditional Daqlah coats and bandoliers, brandishing swords to rhythmic drumming and patriotic poetry, danced by the King and royal family during national celebrations); Mizmar dance of the Hejaz (UNESCO); Step dance of Asir.',
