        travelNotes='Remarkably accessible through instant tourist e-Visas available online for citizens of over 66 countries; high-speed Haramain bullet trains link Mecca, Jeddah, and Medina; ultra-modern, clean, and safe metropolitan infrastructure; cashless economy where credit cards and Apple Pay / Mada are universally accepted; non-Muslim visitors are welcome across the entire country except within the holy precincts of Mecca and the central religious sanctuary of Medina; alcohol is prohibited.',
