        naturalResources=['Crude petroleum and natural gas (northeastern fields: Rumeilan, Al-Omar)', 'Phosphate rock (world-scale mines near Palmyra)', 'Limestone, basalt, and building stone', 'Arable fertile land along the Euphrates and Orontes basins'],
        energy='Severely constrained by damaged power stations; natural gas and heavy oil thermal power plants; ongoing rehabilitation of the Tabqa and Tishreen hydroelectric dams on the Euphrates; rapid adoption of residential and commercial rooftop solar PV panels',
