        tourism='Historic international cultural tourism was a massive pillar before 2011; gradual revival of domestic and regional tourism visiting the Old City of Damascus, Aleppo Citadel, Krak des Chevaliers, Saidnaya and Ma\'loula monasteries, and coastal resorts in Latakia and Tartus.',
        employment='High proportion of workforce in agriculture, civil administration, military, and informal street commerce; remittances sent by the vast Syrian diaspora in the Gulf, Europe, and neighboring host nations are a vital lifeline.',
